            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “For behold, in those days and at that time, when I restore the fortunes of Judah and Jerusalem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will gather all the nations and bring them down to the valley of Jehoshaphat, and I will enter into judgment with them there, on account of my people and my heritage Israel, because they have scattered them among the nations, and have divided up my land, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and have cast lots for my people, and have given a boy for a harlot, and have sold a girl for wine, and have drunk it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
